cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "intelliant: clustering by ant colony optimization on a k-nearest-neighbour graph"
message: "If you use this software in research, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Mikheyev
    given-names: Pavel
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-8644-0558"
    alias: yourdisenchantment
repository-code: "https://github.com/yourdisenchantment/intelliant"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/intelliant/"
abstract: >-
  A clustering library that operates on a k-nearest-neighbour similarity graph
  rather than in feature space. Ant colony optimization reinforces edges inside
  dense regions; clusters are read out of the resulting pheromone field by
  thresholding. The pipeline is deliberately staged - graph construction,
  pheromone extraction and cluster assignment are separate objects, and the
  intermediate state is inspectable and editable between stages.
keywords:
  - clustering
  - ant colony optimization
  - graph algorithms
  - unsupervised learning
